  "narrative": [
    "An empty replica. Before C-31 the shell forwarded these three operations.",
    "Step 0: a custom vocab type with the three mandatory field keys.",
    "Step 1: a vocab type without meaning is 422 invalid_value at /fields (the check the server makes at the op as well, so the device never mints an op the server rejects).",
    "Steps 2-3: updateNoteType css; getNoteType shows it at once.",
    "Steps 4-5: a note of the type (no entry_seq, so no dictionary data is involved); deleting the type is then 409 in_use.",
    "Steps 6-9: after the note is deleted the type can be deleted (204, twice) and answers 410.",
    "Step 10: a built-in type is 409 builtin_immutable."
  ],
